Maintainer: Hannah Johns <dr.hannah.johns@gmail.com>
Description: Facilitates analysis of Generalised Pairwise Comparisons with Prioritised Outcomes
             (e.g. Win Ratio, Win Odds). Includes a wrapper function that enables rank-based
             Desirability of Outcome Ranking analyses with any existing ordinal analysis package
             (e.g. probabilistic index models provided by R package `pim') plus automated input
             processing and a formula-based interface for estimating win statistics
             (using R package `WINS') without needing to restructure or rename the data.
             In both cases, supports improved interpretation of prioritised outcomes analyses
             using the approach proposed by Johns et al. (2026) <doi:10.1177/17474930261475853> where
             the treatment effect is estimated separately for each outcome plus cumulatively
             as they are added to the outcome prioritisation. The contribution of each outcome
             to the overall effect size is then visualised with a supplied plotting function.
